What is adapted from it here (issue #1262):

- The owner's GitHub App (internal/controlplane/githubapp): the manifest's code exchange and the checks of its
  answer (internal/integration/github/setup.go ConvertManifest), reading the App's RSA key and signing its JWT
  (auth.go parsePrivateKey, appJWT), making an installation's token (auth.go mintInstallationToken) and keeping it,
  one maker a key (installation_token_cache.go), checking a delivery's X-Hub-Signature-256 and its headers
  (webhooks.go ValidSignature, validHeaderValue), and the manifest's fields
  (internal/httpapi/github_app_setup_routes.go). Changed: the token is made with every permission the installation
  has and reused until 15 minutes before its end; the credential is one vault secret of the control plane's.
- A worker's gh and git credential helper with a fresh installation token (internal/node/githubapp), from
  internal/machinedaemon/git_credential_helper.go RunGitHubCLI and RunGitCredentialHelper. Changed: the helpers ask
  the control plane's agent API with the Dispatch's key instead of a daemon's local socket.

Files changed by Hypomnema are Hypomnema's; the notices above say what each was adapted from.
